        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/89c04639e14165b29e8f31c52c3e6530.avif?t=1788910874\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blow up rivals with missiles and mines in chaotic top down combat racing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock in <strong>Timebomb</strong>, splat zombies, smash through <strong>destructible tracks, </strong>escape the police!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race on 9 tracks from the sunsets of Monzarello to the neon lit streets of Sakura Raceway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade + 2 seasons of career mode + the driving school (more coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate rivals in 4 main modes (Timebomb, Speed Race, Power Race) + a special career event &quot;<strong>Zombo Blast</strong>&quot; and a Police chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/bbeb1cd7d377292dc8692a076894034e.avif?t=1788910874\" width=905 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from an unknown rookie to  champion, Start learning your moves at the driving school before taking on the best of the best. Work your way to fame and watch your garage change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/4e4d5e75f5d41006da1193d73cf21ba4.poster.avif?t=1788910874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a