gets in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/3eb7c18127089db6ff54111e299d27cb.poster.avif?t=1788910874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/3eb7c18127089db6ff54111e299d27cb.webm?t=1788910874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/3eb7c18127089db6ff54111e299d27cb.mp4?t=1788910874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/6a34669bdd9fef767fa11ae0a6fc6d36.poster.avif?t=1788910874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/6a34669bdd9fef767fa11ae0a6fc6d36.webm?t=1788910874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/6a34669bdd9fef767fa11ae0a6fc6d36.mp4?t=1788910874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/2ee6101a56fc28b2987f00f284699431.avif?t=1788910874\" width=678 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here in the Super Power Racing League we don't settle for just racing, we mix it up! Expect Power Races with weapons, speed boosts and oil slicks and special events like Zombo Blast where you take out as many zombies as you can before your car blows up and a twilight police chase on Koi Speedpark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pl